5b:["$","p",null,{"children":["The URL Path identifies the endpoint of the application that you are trying to access or modify. You can find the URL path details in the Official API documentation. The URL path shown in the examples below is specific to one Magento 2 (AdobeCommerce) entity, i.e., product. However, if you want to work with a different entity (such as customers, orders, etc.), simply refer to the API documentation link provided.\n",["$","$L7",null,{"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 70vw, 900px","alt":"url path","src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/url-path.01i0~5evy8aep.png","width":1190,"height":143,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":1,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAgAAAABCAYAAADjAO9DAAAAGUlEQVR42mP4+OnT/9+/f///+/cfFvz3PwAGhB+OC3RgqgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="},"className":"rounded-lg"}]]}]
